  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Initiation Plan (IP) for Scaling the Local Government Initiative on Climate Change (LoGIC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Initiation Plan (IP) will run for a duration of 12 months; it will be a preparatory phase aimed at bridging the gap between the completion of LoGIC I and the development, approval, and launch of LoGIC II, which will lead to full-scale roll-out. The LoGIC IP is designed as a transition and readiness phase that directly supports the GoB in aligning climate adaptation financing and governance with national priorities and strategies. The goal is to provide support to the Local Government Divisio</narrative>
  </description>
